---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Bridgeway"
  description="Privacy Policy for Bridgeway practice management software."
  ogTitle="Privacy Policy — Bridgeway"
  ogDescription="Privacy Policy for Bridgeway practice management software."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-medium text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-5">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-neutral-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-12">Last updated: May 28, 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-neutral prose-sm max-w-none
        [&_h2]:font-serif [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:text-neutral-900 [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:mt-12 [&_h2]:mb-4
        [&_h3]:font-serif [&_h3]:text-lg [&_h3]:text-neutral-900 [&_h3]:mt-8 [&_h3]:mb-3
        [&_p]:text-neutral-600 [&_p]:leading-relaxed [&_p]:font-light [&_p]:mb-4
        [&_ul]:text-neutral-600 [&_ul]:font-light [&_ul]:space-y-1.5 [&_ul]:mb-4
        [&_li]:leading-relaxed
        [&_strong]:text-neutral-900 [&_strong]:font-medium">

        <p>Bridgeway Apps LLC ("Bridgeway," "we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use the Bridgeway platform.</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

        <h3>Information you provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Name, email address, practice name, and billing details when you create an account.</li>
          <li><strong>Client data:</strong> Names, email addresses, phone numbers, appointment details, and other administrative data you enter about your clients.</li>
          <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Any messages you send us via email or support channels.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Pages visited, features used, timestamps, and general interaction patterns.</li>
          <li><strong>Device information:</strong> Browser type, operating system, screen resolution, and IP address.</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use essential cookies for authentication and session management. No third-party advertising cookies are used.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To provide, maintain, and improve the Bridgeway platform.</li>
          <li>To process payments and manage your subscription.</li>
          <li>To send appointment reminders and booking confirmations on behalf of your practice.</li>
          <li>To send important service updates, security alerts, and billing notices.</li>
          <li>To provide customer support.</li>
          <li>To detect and prevent fraud or abuse.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Bridgeway uses trusted third-party services to operate the platform:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Firebase (Google Cloud):</strong> Authentication, database, and hosting infrastructure.</li>
          <li><strong>Stripe:</strong> Payment processing. Stripe handles all credit card data directly and is PCI DSS compliant.</li>
          <li><strong>SendGrid (Twilio):</strong> Transactional email delivery for booking confirmations and reminders.</li>
          <li><strong>Twilio:</strong> SMS delivery for appointment reminders.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Calendar API:</strong> Calendar sync, when enabled by your practice.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <p>Your data is stored on Google Cloud infrastructure (Firebase) with encryption at rest and in transit. We implement industry-standard security measures including TLS/SSL encryption, Firebase Authentication, role-based access controls, and configurable session timeouts.</p>

        <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active. After cancellation, data is retained for 90 days then permanently deleted. Billing records may be retained longer as required by law.</p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may request access, correction, deletion, or export of your personal data by contacting contact@bridgewayapps.com. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

        <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Bridgeway is not intended for individuals under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>Material changes will be communicated via email or in-app notification.</p>

        <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p><strong>Bridgeway Apps LLC</strong><br />Email: contact@bridgewayapps.com</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-neutral-100">
        <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">Back to Bridgeway</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
